  "html": "<p>We are beyond thrilled to announce the addition of a new chiropractor, Dr. Daniel Meers, to our team!</p>\n<p>Dr. Meers brings over 15 years of experience in chiropractic care, with a strong background in treating personal injury, workers’ compensation, and general wellness patients. But what truly sets him apart is why he chose this profession.</p>\n<p>His journey into chiropractic care began as a patient after a car accident in his hometown of Canton, Ohio. After experiencing severe neck and low back pain, he found relief through hands-on, personalized chiropractic treatment—and within just a few visits, he was pain-free. That life-changing experience inspired him to pursue a career where he could provide that same level of care to others.</p>\n<p>Since earning his Doctor of Chiropractic degree from New York Chiropractic College, Dr. Meers has practiced in Ohio and the Philadelphia area, working in high-volume, multidisciplinary settings and helping thousands of patients get out of pain and back to living their lives.</p>\n<p>Dr. Meers utilizes a variety of techniques including Diversified, Activator, Cox Flexion/Distraction, and soft tissue therapies, allowing him to tailor care to each individual patient.</p>\n<p>Outside the office, he enjoys spending time with his family, cycling, playing disc golf, and watching Formula 1.</p>\n<p>We’re very excited to have Dr. Meers on board and know our patients are going to love his friendly, personalized approach to care.  Dr. Meers will be seeing patients at our Newark office, located at <a href=\"https://www.google.com/maps/search/54+Omega+Drive,+Building+F,+Newark,+DE+19713?entry=gmail&amp;source=g\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">54 Omega Drive, Building F, Newark, DE 19713</a>.</p>",
